{"excerpt_id":"ex_accb45067034_008","source_id":"src_accb45067034","source_hash":"c16307356c58020785fa1acabb05a6017b0ae6de86987fe74689904e11a304b1","text":"Setup and run your first Arweave miner","location_hint":"paragraph 51","char_start":1113,"char_end":1151,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T22:22:13.815Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_accb45067034_009","source_id":"src_accb45067034","source_hash":"c16307356c58020785fa1acabb05a6017b0ae6de86987fe74689904e11a304b1","text":"This guide walks you through planning, installing, and bringing an Arweave miner online for the first time.","location_hint":"paragraph 52","char_start":1155,"char_end":1262,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T22:22:13.815Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_accb45067034_010","source_id":"src_accb45067034","source_hash":"c16307356c58020785fa1acabb05a6017b0ae6de86987fe74689904e11a304b1","text":"For any questions and support queries regarding mining on Arweave, we strongly recommend that you join our Discord server arrow-up-right and visit our Discussions Board arrow-up-right as these are the hubs of our mining and developer communities. There you will find plenty of community members and Arweave team members available to help you out 🤖","location_hint":"paragraph 54","char_start":1277,"char_end":1625,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T22:22:13.815Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_accb45067034_011","source_id":"src_accb45067034","source_hash":"c16307356c58020785fa1acabb05a6017b0ae6de86987fe74689904e11a304b1","text":"Miners are responsible for their own compliance with data protection laws (such as GDPR) and other applicable laws in their jurisdiction. Data storage laws vary country to country. Failure to adhere to these laws may entail substantial legal risks for the miner. Please only participate in mining Arweave data if you have understood the legal implications of doing so and consider seeking legal advice.","location_hint":"paragraph 56","char_start":1647,"char_end":2049,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T22:22:13.815Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_accb45067034_012","source_id":"src_accb45067034","source_hash":"c16307356c58020785fa1acabb05a6017b0ae6de86987fe74689904e11a304b1","text":"Decide whether you are running a solo miner, coordinated miner, pool miner, VDF server, or validator.","location_hint":"paragraph 59","char_start":2086,"char_end":2187,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T22:22:13.815Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_accb45067034_013","source_id":"src_accb45067034","source_hash":"c16307356c58020785fa1acabb05a6017b0ae6de86987fe74689904e11a304b1","text":"Size CPU, memory, storage, and network based on your chosen role.","location_hint":"paragraph 62","char_start":2221,"char_end":2286,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T22:22:13.815Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_accb45067034_014","source_id":"src_accb45067034","source_hash":"c16307356c58020785fa1acabb05a6017b0ae6de86987fe74689904e11a304b1","text":"3. Configure the Operating System","location_hint":"paragraph 64","char_start":2297,"char_end":2330,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T22:22:13.815Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_accb45067034_015","source_id":"src_accb45067034","source_hash":"c16307356c58020785fa1acabb05a6017b0ae6de86987fe74689904e11a304b1","text":"Configure your operating system for Arweave workloads.","location_hint":"paragraph 65","char_start":2332,"char_end":2386,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T22:22:13.815Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_accb45067034_016","source_id":"src_accb45067034","source_hash":"c16307356c58020785fa1acabb05a6017b0ae6de86987fe74689904e11a304b1","text":"Install the node software either from pre-built binaries or by building from source, and verify the installation.","location_hint":"paragraph 68","char_start":2426,"char_end":2539,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T22:22:13.815Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_accb45067034_017","source_id":"src_accb45067034","source_hash":"c16307356c58020785fa1acabb05a6017b0ae6de86987fe74689904e11a304b1","text":"5. Setup Your Directory Structure","location_hint":"paragraph 70","char_start":2550,"char_end":2583,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T22:22:13.815Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_accb45067034_018","source_id":"src_accb45067034","source_hash":"c16307356c58020785fa1acabb05a6017b0ae6de86987fe74689904e11a304b1","text":"Create the directories and links for your data_dir and storage modules.","location_hint":"paragraph 71","char_start":2585,"char_end":2656,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T22:22:13.815Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_accb45067034_019","source_id":"src_accb45067034","source_hash":"c16307356c58020785fa1acabb05a6017b0ae6de86987fe74689904e11a304b1","text":"All nodes need a configured wallet (aka mining key), if you don&#x27;t specify one it will be created for you. If you&#x27;re not mining, this default wallet is probably fine. For miners:","location_hint":"paragraph 74","char_start":2695,"char_end":2882,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T22:22:13.815Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_accb45067034_020","source_id":"src_accb45067034","source_hash":"c16307356c58020785fa1acabb05a6017b0ae6de86987fe74689904e11a304b1","text":"7. Configure and Run Your Node","location_hint":"paragraph 76","char_start":2893,"char_end":2923,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T22:22:13.815Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_accb45067034_021","source_id":"src_accb45067034","source_hash":"c16307356c58020785fa1acabb05a6017b0ae6de86987fe74689904e11a304b1","text":"Depending on your node type, operating phase, and different elements of your hardware and system configuration you will want to run your node with a different set of configuration options. We&#x27;ve provided a few examples in the Node Configuration Guide to get you started.","location_hint":"paragraph 77","char_start":2925,"char_end":3200,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T22:22:13.815Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_accb45067034_022","source_id":"src_accb45067034","source_hash":"c16307356c58020785fa1acabb05a6017b0ae6de86987fe74689904e11a304b1","text":"8. Learn, Iterate, and Optimize","location_hint":"paragraph 79","char_start":3211,"char_end":3242,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T22:22:13.815Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_accb45067034_023","source_id":"src_accb45067034","source_hash":"c16307356c58020785fa1acabb05a6017b0ae6de86987fe74689904e11a304b1","text":"After you get your node running, we recommend familiarizing yourself with the rest of the Mining Guide, joining the Discord Server arrow-up-right , and reviewing the Discussions Board arrow-up-right . There is a lot to learn and you will likely hit issues as you ramp up and tune your Arweave node - hopefully these resources will help you through it.","location_hint":"paragraph 80","char_start":3244,"char_end":3595,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T22:22:13.815Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_accb45067034_024","source_id":"src_accb45067034","source_hash":"c16307356c58020785fa1acabb05a6017b0ae6de86987fe74689904e11a304b1","text":"Thank you for supporting the Permaweb!","location_hint":"paragraph 81","char_start":3597,"char_end":3635,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T22:22:13.815Z"}
